# ── examples/voice-llm-vue/server.mjs configuration ────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` (or just export these) and run `npm run server`.
#
# With NEITHER block set, the server runs FULLY OFFLINE: a fake AmiVoice upstream
# and a fake OpenAI-compatible LLM. You can click through the whole demo with no
# credentials. Fill in a block to switch that surface to the real thing.

# ── AmiVoice (speech recognition) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get a free trial key + coupon from https://acp.amivoice.com/ . When set, the
# server relays browser audio to the real AmiVoice WSS. The key never reaches the
# browser — it stays in this process.
# AMIVOICE_APPKEY=

# ── LLM (the "生成AI" half) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When AI_API_KEY is set, the server-side AiCore calls the real provider. The key
# stays in this process; the browser only ever sees streamed `content`.
#
# Recommended: Anthropic Claude.
#   AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
#   AI_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5         # fast + cheap; swap to claude-sonnet-4-6 for richer summaries
#   AI_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# Or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint:
#   AI_PROVIDER=openai
#   AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#   AI_API_KEY=sk-...
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# AI_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
# AI_API_KEY=

# System prompt the server pins onto every LLM call (clients cannot override it).
# AI_SYSTEM=あなたは会議の書記です。文字起こしを3点以内で日本語要約し、ToDoがあれば「ToDo:」として箇条書きしてください。

# PORT=3200
